/// requires: db
/// known-gap: vm db_* builtins are not in the VM builtin table
/// known-gap: interp json/jsonb are not decoded (sql_cell_to_value falls through to nil); campfire casts to text to work around it
/// Non-NULL json and jsonb columns do not read as nil.
r | :db_query_one("SELECT '[1,2]'::json AS j, '[3]'::jsonb AS jb", [])
say(:is_nil(r["j"]))
say(:is_nil(r["jb"]))
